# Dùng với VS Code "REST Client" hoặc JetBrains HTTP Client. Chạy `npm run db:reset && npm run dev` trước.
# UUID seed cố định (xem README).

@base = http://localhost:3000
@openCart = c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@closedCart = c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@p1 = a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@p2 = a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@p3 = a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@p4OutOfStock = a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
@p5Inactive = a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005

### 1. Login (user / 1234) → lấy access_token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 2. Login sai → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "sai" }

### 3. Danh sách product (không cần token) → 4 product đang bán
GET {{base}}/products?limit=20&offset=0

### 4. limit sai → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{base}}/products?limit=51

### 5. Tạo cart → 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Không token → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}

### 7. Xem cart
GET {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Thêm P1 x2 → 201
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p1}}", "quantity": 2 }

### 9. Thêm P3 x3 → 201, subtotal_cents = 59700
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p3}}", "quantity": 3 }

### 10. Đổi số lượng P1 → 200
PATCH {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items/{{p1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 4 }

### 11. Xoá P1 → 204
DELETE {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items/{{p1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Request sai (400 VALIDATION_ERROR) ---

### 12. quantity = 0
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p1}}", "quantity": 0 }

### 13. quantity = 11
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p1}}", "quantity": 11 }

### 14. quantity = "2" (chuỗi)
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p1}}", "quantity": "2" }

### 15. Thiếu product_id
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

### 16. Field lạ
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p1}}", "quantity": 2, "price": 1 }

### 17. cartId không phải uuid → 400
GET {{base}}/carts/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. cartId hợp lệ nhưng không tồn tại → 404 CART_NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/carts/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Nghiệp vụ ---

### 19. Product ngừng bán → 422 PRODUCT_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p5Inactive}}", "quantity": 1 }

### 20. Vượt stock (P2 stock = 5) → 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p2}}", "quantity": 6 }

### 21. Hết hàng (P4 stock = 0) → 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p4OutOfStock}}", "quantity": 1 }

### 22. Ghi vào cart đã checkout → 409 CART_CLOSED
POST {{base}}/carts/{{closedCart}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": "{{p3}}", "quantity": 1 }

### 23. Thêm trùng (chạy lại #8 hai lần) → 409 ITEM_ALREADY_IN_CART
### 24. PATCH/DELETE item không có trong cart → 404 ITEM_NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{base}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items/{{p2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
